# Google Drive Architecture & Zero-Data-Loss Migration: Walkthrough

We have transformed the Sigma HRMS Document Management system into a **Google Drive-style Document Management Platform** while preserving 100% of existing documents and metadata.

---

## 1. Migration Results (Zero Data Loss)

The idempotent migration script (`src/scripts/migrate-documents-to-drive.ts`) completed successfully:

- **📚 Company Library Documents**: 603 files migrated into hierarchical folder structures.
- **🚀 Project Documents**: 10,555 files migrated into hierarchical folder structures.
- **📁 Total Nested Folders Created**: 1,344 folders generated automatically from existing category paths.
- **📄 Total Files Managed**: 11,158 files.
- **💾 Total Storage Data Preserved**: ~146.22 GB mapped with zero MinIO re-uploads or physical moves.

