## 2. Key Architecture Components Built

### A. Database Schema (`prisma/schema.prisma`)
- **`DriveItem`**: Self-referencing tree model with `parentId`, materialized `path` (`/root-id/folder-id/`), `depth`, `color`, `scope` (`ORGANIZATION_LIBRARY`, `PROJECT`, `PERSONAL`), `isStarred`, `isTrashed`, `version`.
- **`DriveStarredItem`**: Per-user bookmarking/starring.
- **`DriveItemPermission`**: Granular access control for users, departments, and public tokens.
- **`DriveVersion`**: File revision history tracking.
- **`DriveActivity`**: Audit trail timeline logging for all item actions.

### B. Server Actions & APIs (`src/actions/drive.ts` & `/api/drive/*`)
- `getDriveContents`: Query engine with support for scope filtering, search by name, type filtering (PDF, Spreadsheet, Word, Image, Presentation, Archive, Media), sorting, and breadcrumb generation.
- `createDriveFolder`, `renameDriveItem`, `moveDriveItems` (with recursive subfolder path recalculation).
- `toggleStarDriveItem`, `trashDriveItems` (soft-delete), `restoreDriveItems`, `deleteDriveItemsPermanently`.
- `getDriveDownloadUrl` (24-hour presigned URL), `getDriveStorageStats`.
- Direct MinIO upload via presigned PUT URLs (`/api/drive/presigned-url`) and metadata registration (`/api/drive/confirm-upload`).

